on list (path = "")
	//List the contents of a REPL focus table (or the current one).
		//5/8/26 by JES
			//Issue #594 — accept optional path arg so the slash-command and
			//palette accepts_args paths both route through this handler via
			//the unified palette_arg_inject synthesis. Empty / missing path
			//falls through to repl.list (""), which lists the current focus
			//table (existing behavior). This wraps repl.list with whatever
			//path the dispatch path supplied; a future revision could prompt
			//for a path interactively via the palette accepts_args input row.
	repl.list (path)
	return (true)
